  <note xml:lang="ta" target="#murukku"><term xml:lang="en">Cf. IAC1, p. 26:</term> pālaikku… mā valiyaḻinta yāṉaiyum puliyuñ cennāyum; maram iruppaiyum ōmaiyum; puḷ kaḻukum paruntum puṟavum…; pū marāmpūvuṅ kurāmpūvum pātirippūvum</note>
