  <note xml:lang="ta" target="#tara"><term xml:lang="en">Cf. IAC1, p. 27:</term> marutattukku… mā eṟumaiyum nīrnāyum; maram vañciyuṅ kāñciyum marutum; puḷ nīrkkōḻiyun tārāvum…; pū tāmaraippūvuñ ceṅkaḻunīrppūvum</note>
    <note xml:lang="ta" target="#akanril"><term xml:lang="en">Cf. IAC1, p. 25–26:</term> neytaṟku… mā cuṟāvum mutalaiyum; maram puṉṉaiyum ñāḻaluṅ kaṇṭalum; puḷ aṉṉamum aṉṟilu makaṉṟilum…; pū veḷḷitaḻk kaitaiyum neytalum</note>
